D[31012]={"^Increases attack power by (.-) and an additional (.-) every (.-) sec%.  Lasts (.-)%.%s*$","Aumenta seu poder de ataque em {{1}} e adicionalmente {{2}} a cada {{3}} s. Dura {{4}}."}
D[31013]={"^Instantly attack with both weapons for (.-)%% weapon damage%.%s*$","Ataca instantaneamente com as duas armas em {{1}}% de dano da arma."}
