D[33248]={"^Dealing damage with Chain Lightning causes you to discharge |cFFFFFFFFSpellstorm Arcane Missiles|r, dealing (.-) Spellstorm damage%.%s*$","Causar dano com Relâmpago Cepa dispara |cFFFFFFFFMísseis Arcanos da Tempestade Mágica|r, causando {{1}} de dano de Tempestade Mágico."}
